+    }
+
+    // === Tile (cards / struct) ===
+    // The handle ⠿ is the drag source; the tile wrapper is the drop
+    // zone. Stop propagation on dragstart so an outer tile (nested
+    // grids) doesn't re-snapshot its own card.
